---
const imagePath = "/images/duene.jpg";
---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
    <img
        class="hero-image"
        src={imagePath}
        alt="Ein stiller Blick über Dünengras, Strand und Meer unter einem weiten Himmel."
        width="2000"
        height="1126"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
    />
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1 id="hero-heading">
            <span><span class="accent">Fühlen</span> ist anders,</span>
            <span>wenn jemand mit der Welle bleibt.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
            Manchmal ist Fühlen eine große Welle. Manchmal ist es nur eine
            Ahnung. Ich begleite dich in deinen Gezeiten. In einem Raum, in dem
            du aus dem Kopf ins Spüren und aus der Reaktion in Kontakt finden
            darfst.
        </p>
        <div class="actions hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/angebote/wutraum">Wutraum entdecken</a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="mailto:ta.kupler@gmail.com"
                >Kontakt aufnehmen</a
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .hero {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        height: 76vh;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 3.5rem);
        isolation: isolate;
    }

    .hero-image {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .hero-image {
        z-index: -1;
        filter: saturate(0.86) sepia(0.08) brightness(1.04) contrast(0.94);
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center 38%;
    }

    .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        max-width: 54rem;
        padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem)
            clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
        color: #f4efe6;
    }

    h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #f4efe6;
        font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 4.6vw, 4.7rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.02;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        text-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgb(35 43 36 / 0.28);
    }

    h1 span {
        display: block;
    }

    h1 .accent {
        display: inline;
        color: #c97b5a;
    }

    .hero-copy {
        max-width: 40rem;
        margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
        color: #f4efe6;
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);
        text-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgb(35 43 36 / 0.28);
    }

    .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        margin-top: 2.25rem;
    }

    .button {
        padding: 0.75rem 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 1.5;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition:
            background-color 200ms ease-out,
            color 200ms ease-out,
            filter 200ms ease-out;
    }

    .button-primary {
        background: #c97b5a;
        color: #232b24;
    }

    .button-secondary {
        background: #f4efe6;
        color: #232b24;
    }

    .button:hover {
        filter: brightness(0.96);
    }

    .button:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid #f4efe6;
        outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 40rem) {
        .hero {
            height: 75svh;
        }

        .hero-content {
            padding: 2rem 2rem 3.5rem;
        }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .button {
            transition: none;
        }
    }
</style>
